61	     * The REGION portion of {@code memberId} &mdash; everything before its fixed-width
62	     * {@code <FY><HASH8><CHK>} tail (and before any de-duplication suffix) &mdash; or
63	     * {@link CityRegion#UNKNOWN} when the id is absent or carries no region.
64	     */
